  "description": "Jegal Hyun, the youngest team leader at a design company. With a blessed(?) personality, he's been living by nagging those around him for 32 years. One day, he's suddenly kidnapped by a UFO! Waking up in an unfamiliar place, Jegal Hyun is subjected to a \"development\" experiment in front of the spaceship's captain, Callisto, and the director of the research center...\n\n*\"It's not like I get dizzy just from adding XX to XXX like an ambitious person! What do you think men are?\"\n\"Me, I feel inferior?\"\n\"I'm a man!\"*\n\nLet's begin ▷▶ Female corruption experiment!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
